# Standard Documentation

## Purpose

Establish and enforce consistent documentation standards across the SelOps operational platform.

## Guidelines

- All modules must include a README with purpose, usage, and configuration sections.
- API contracts must be documented before implementation begins.
- ADRs (Architecture Decision Records) capture significant design choices.

